1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:52,920
400 years ago

25
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:59,560
All the Nascent Soul leaders of Zhao have arrived.

26
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,520
Greetings Envoy.

27
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:03,800
Everyone,

28
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:07,760
the country of Zhao has been stuck at rank 3 for too long.

29
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:11,640
We need a talented cultivator who can grow quickly

30
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:14,760
and reach the level of Soul Formation.

31
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,560
If our plan succeeds

32
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:20,040
the country of Zhao will become a rank 4 cultivation country.

33
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,040
Grow quickly ?

34
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,560
Lord Envoy, you are brillant.

35
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,600
This could be our chance.

36
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,640
Lord Envoy,

37
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,560
may I ask what kind of plan you have ?

38
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,880
We just need to gather all the Spirit Roots of Zhao

39
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:37,520
and feed this endless unused spiritual energy

40
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,240
to a single talented individual.

41
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,560
It can speed up the cultivation

42
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,600
so that one can reach Soul Formation.

43
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,280
This...

44
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,960
Taking the Spirit Roots of the mortals ?

45
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,840
Cultivators should not interfere with the lives of mortals.

46
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,600
I'm afraid...

47
00:02:52,810 --> 00:02:54,890
The Ancestors will make the right decision.

48
00:02:57,040 --> 00:03:00,160
Everything is ready, we should seize this opportunity.

49
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,880
I gathered you here today

50
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:07,120
to decide who that talented person will be.

51
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,960
Lord Envoy,

52
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,200
If mortals lose their Spirit Roots,

53
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,840
they will lose the ability to cultivate

54
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:15,160
and our sects of Zhao will not have any new disiples...

55
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,720
This will be the last generation of cultivators.

56
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,000
Envoy, please think twice about it.

57
00:03:20,010 --> 00:03:22,490
Envoy, please think twice about it.

58
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,720
Think twice ?

59
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,920
Lord Envoy, calm down.

60
00:03:32,790 --> 00:03:35,960
It's fellow cultivators that need to think twice.

61
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,960
This plan

62
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,360
will not destroy the mortal world.

63
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:43,040
If the Country of Zhao reaches rank 4

64
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,400
the availability of ressources will increase.

65
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:49,680
The spiritual energy from the Spirit Roots will be returned to the mortals.

66
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:52,520
There is no need to worry about the next generation.

67
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,000
Lord Envoy,

68
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:58,000
my Teng Family is the top cultivation family in Zhao.

69
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,680
We have many talented individuals.

70
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:02,310
The Teng Family

71
00:04:02,330 --> 00:04:06,400
has already formed cultivation pairs with geniuses of many sects.

72
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,240
We have power all over Zhao,

73
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:12,640
we can quickly set up formations in the Spirit Veins everywhere

74
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,840
and gather the Spirit Roots.

75
00:04:15,090 --> 00:04:18,640
My Teng Family is definitely be the best choice for this plan.

76
00:04:18,910 --> 00:04:19,600
Good.

77
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,840
I have put the Spirit Gathering Formation in this jade.

78
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,170
When your Teng Family is ready,

79
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:26,880
you can start extracting the Spirit Roots.

80
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:31,000
I will choose the lucky one from your Teng Family.

81
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,480
Thank you Lord Envoy,

82
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,800
the Teng Family will not disappoint you !

83
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,680
Piao Nanzi,

84
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,760
your Xuan Dao Sect

85
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:42,400
doesn't need to go to the Foreign Battelfield this time.

86
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,040
From now on, your Xuan Dao Sect

87
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:48,280
will provide assistance to the Teng Family.

88
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,560
Understood...

89
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,160
Lord Envoy...

90
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,360
Brother Piao,

91
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,560
if I die here

92
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:04,440
Lord Envoy will not let you live either.

93
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,040
If it weren't for Lord Envoy's order,

94
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,440
do you think I would protect your Teng Family ?

95
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:10,560
Piao Nanzi
Xuan Dao Sect Leader
Late stage Nascent Soul

96
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,800
Do you think you can protect him alone ?

97
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,840
Who are you ?

98
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,290
You !

99
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,760
Teng Huayuan !

100
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,080
Do you dare to fight me ?

101
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,760
It's you !

102
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,040
It turns out he grew to such a level...

103
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:38,680
Break !

104
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,760
Not gonna die ?

105
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,800
Since you're able to block this attack,

106
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:10,560
Piao Nanzi, you're indeed the top expert of Zhao.

107
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,880
I want to see

108
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,880
how long you will last.

109
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,040
For 400 years,

110
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,410
Lin Yi, the Envoy of Heaven's Tower

111
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:28,280
interfered with the development of Zhao.

112
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,520
To save my Xuan Dao Sect,

113
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,600
I had to collude with the Teng Family.

114
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,360
Now the country of Zhao

115
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,520
is in a state of chaos

116
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:38,880
and the mortal world is collapsing...

117
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:43,280
Yet I must help the wicked to destroy Zhao...

118
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,160
Greetings Lord Envoy.

119
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,640
Since you uprooted my hundred years old plan,

120
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,360
you deserve to die.

121
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,720
However,

122
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,960
if you hand over the Heaven Defying Bead,

123
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,880
I will spare your life

124
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,200
and let you use the Spirit Veins.

125
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,560
How does it sound ?

126
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,800
Lord Envoy !

127
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,530
I said that

128
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:20,320
those who help Teng Huayuan

129
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,880
must die !

130
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:44,800
You have good spells

131
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,920
but compared to me

132
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,360
you are insignificant.

133
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,240
Little brat,

134
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,760
you will regret this.

135
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:30,400
I have been waiting for this for a long time !

136
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,040
Divine Retribution ?

137
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,480
Take my place !

138
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,040
Consider it an honor.

139
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,200
Burning your lifespan ?

140
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,560
What are you doing ?!

141
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:13,600
Now that it has come to this, you want to escape ?

142
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:17,640
Do you think the mortals of Zhao will agree ?

143
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:18,800
What the hell are you talking about ?

144
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,160
I am the Envoy of Heaven's Tower !

145
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,800
I was able to hold you back enough...

146
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:32,440
I am satisfied...

147
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,920
I calculated everything...

148
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:06,160
But I never expected the Teng Family

149
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:11,040
could be destroyed by a small fry like you !

150
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:15,320
It's ridiculous...

151
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,600
Don't be so presomptuous.

152
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:30,960
Look !

153
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:34,160
You are the one who sacrified them.

154
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,760
Their souls are leaving their bodies

155
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:41,110
because you killed them with your own hands.

156
00:11:41,130 --> 00:11:43,080
You forced me to !

157
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,640
Wang Lin,

158
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:46,240
I curse you

159
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,000
to die alone,

160
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,920
to have a terrible death !

161
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,160
Teng Huanyuan,

162
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:55,000
how did you find my hometown ?

163
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,360
You will never know.

164
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,360
Not willing to talk ?

165
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,520
I will.

166
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:23,560
Gao Qiming from the Piao Miao Sect

167
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:27,680
helped me find your family using his divination spells.

168
00:12:28,410 --> 00:12:29,680
Gao Qiming...

169
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,720
I will remember this name.

170
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,440
You...

171
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,760
can go to hell.

172
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:47,120
Gao Qiming
Piao Miao Sect Leader
Late stage Nascent Soul

173
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,400
A memory formation ?

174
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,120
400 years ago,

175
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:19,400
I was asked by Teng Huayuan

176
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:24,160
to find the hometown of a Foundation Establishment cultivator.

177
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:26,230
It caused a great disaster.

178
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:29,880
But I protected the bloodline of Wang Tiantu, your family.

179
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,560
I believe in the heaven and earth

180
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:36,160
and in the cycle of cause and effect.

181
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:39,000
As I have forseen, I will die today.

182
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:42,920
Please don't involve the Piao Miao Sect.

183
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:05,880
Father...

184
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:07,200
Mother...

185
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,120
I have avenged you.

186
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:13,360
I will now embark on my own path.

187
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:22,760
Senior Situ,

188
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,320
the day I reach Soul Transformation

189
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,520
is the day you will awaken

190
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,480
and regain your freedom.

191
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:44,400
Dear, Tie Zhu,

192
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:45,520
let's eat.

193
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:10,640
400 years

194
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,480
passed in the blink of an eye.

195
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,000
When I was young, I wanted my parents to be respected

196
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:18,200
so I stepped in the cultivation world.

197
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,560
Unexpectedly, mortal and Immortal are separated.

198
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,840
To get my revenge,

199
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,040
I had to kill my way through

200
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:27,160
and force myself to get stronger.

201
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,070
Now that my revenge is done,

202
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:32,030
I can leave this place

203
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,920
to explore this vast universe

204
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,390
that is brimming with life.

205
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,720
I, Wang Lin, will never stop growing.

206
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,160
I will defy the heavens.

207
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,760
No matter how difficult the journey is,

208
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:46,160
I will forge my own path.

209
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,120
That's because...

210
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,320
if my cultivation is not high enough,

211
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:53,040
I cannot protect the people that are important to me.

212
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:57,920
My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.

213
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,080
You can always come back,

214
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,040
we will always be there for you.

215
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,310
Tie Zhu...

216
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:07,800
you look like an Immortal now.

217
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:11,320
I have never been so proud in my life.

218
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:13,120
From now on, I will teach you cultivation.

219
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,200
Focus your mind on your breathing !

220
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,400
I want to stay in the Cloud Sky Sect.

221
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,740
Only here do I have the right conditions to try to refine grade 6 pills.

222
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,440
That way I can be useful to you in the future.

223
00:17:34,180 --> 00:19:49,780
I guess it's about time to tell you that the whole subplot of the Spirit Veins is donghua original. I think it was added to dilute Wang Lin's genocide of the Teng Family. In the novel he just killed every single one of them in cold blood (except Teng Xiuxiu).

Another way they dilute Wang Lin's actions is by making Teng Huayuan use the Reverse Formation to kill his family himself to get stronger. None of that happens in the novel, just a pure massacre.

224
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:46,370
I've had my share of wounds,

225
00:17:44,530 --> 00:17:46,370
now I want to fight back.

226
00:17:46,450 --> 00:17:49,930
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

227
00:17:50,010 --> 00:17:55,850
that's blocking all my hopes

228
00:17:52,890 --> 00:17:55,850
for life ?

229
00:17:57,650 --> 00:18:01,610
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

230
00:17:59,370 --> 00:18:01,610
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

231
00:18:01,930 --> 00:18:05,010
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

232
00:18:05,370 --> 00:18:11,010
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

233
00:18:08,090 --> 00:18:11,010
out of reach.

234
00:18:12,370 --> 00:18:16,490
Immortals

235
00:18:13,410 --> 00:18:16,490
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

236
00:18:16,770 --> 00:18:20,530
Renegades

237
00:18:17,530 --> 00:18:20,530
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

238
00:18:20,530 --> 00:18:24,370
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

239
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:24,370
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

240
00:18:24,610 --> 00:18:28,490
because I don't see the harm in that.

241
00:18:30,490 --> 00:18:36,290
My new body opens its eyes

242
00:18:33,010 --> 00:18:36,290
and awakens from its dream.

243
00:18:36,410 --> 00:18:43,850
I have overcome many trials

244
00:18:38,530 --> 00:18:43,850
to get this body back.

245
00:18:44,050 --> 00:18:51,490
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

246
00:18:48,090 --> 00:18:51,490
I can still see.

247
00:18:51,890 --> 00:19:00,850
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

248
00:18:55,850 --> 00:19:00,850
by my own hands.

249
00:19:16,290 --> 00:19:22,250
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

250
00:19:19,010 --> 00:19:22,250
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

251
00:19:22,250 --> 00:19:29,810
With a flick of a finger,

252
00:19:23,690 --> 00:19:29,810
only my indomitable heart remains.

253
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:39,210
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

254
00:19:35,810 --> 00:19:39,210
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

255
00:19:39,450 --> 00:19:47,050
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

256
00:19:41,970 --> 00:19:47,050
like the descent of a god.
